(text "J2: center-positive REGULATED 5V ONLY.\nJ6 is a parallel power landing; same-polarity lugs are commoned.\nJ7 pin2 supplies 12V servo distribution; it never powers the Mega." (at 15.24 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) ) (justify left top)) (uuid "eb223a8d-fc6b-5ff1-8a41-22b5789859eb"))
